{"text":"孝昌二年五月八日，左藏令榮九州仰為父母眷屬現世安□、自身康保、眾惡消滅、仕進日昇、吉慶月集，十方眾生皆緣此……","tags":[{"name":"Office","term":"左藏令","refId":null,"text":"左藏令","start":9,"end":12},{"name":"PersonName","term":"榮九州","refId":null,"text":"榮九州","start":12,"end":15},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"十方","refId":null,"text":"十方","start":46,"end":48},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"眾生","start":48,"end":50}]}